<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Cyber Hacking Lab</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background: #050807;
    color: #e8fff0;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

header {
    min-height: 90vh;
    padding: 25px 8%;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(0,255,100,.12), transparent 35%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(0,255,100,.08), transparent 35%),
        #050807;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 0 40px;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #39ff88;
}

.logo span {
    color: white;
}

nav a {
    color: #b8c8be;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 25px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #39ff88;
}

.hero {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: auto 0;
    padding: 50px 0;
}

.tag {
    color: #39ff88;
    font-family: monospace;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 78px);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

h1 span {
    color: #39ff88;
}

.hero p {
    color: #aab8ae;
    font-size: 18px;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #39ff88;
    color: #031008;
    padding: 13px 22px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-right: 10px;
}

.btn.secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: #39ff88;
    border: 1px solid #39ff88;
}

section {
    padding: 80px 8%;
}

.section-title {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section-title small {
    color: #39ff88;
    font-family: monospace;
}

.section-title h2 {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-top: 8px;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: #0b110d;
    border: 1px solid #1a3021;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: .25s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: #39ff88;
}

.icon {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #39ff88;
}

.card p {
    color: #93a39a;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.terminal {
    background: #020402;
    border: 1px solid #1f4a2c;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(57,255,136,.08);
}

.terminal-bar {
    background: #101711;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    color: #7f9185;
    font-family: monospace;
}

.terminal-body {
    padding: 25px;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: #39ff88;
    min-height: 220px;
}

.terminal-body .white {
    color: #eee;
}

.progress {
    margin-top: 18px;
    height: 8px;
    background: #18231c;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.progress span {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: 35%;
    background: #39ff88;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px 8%;
    border-top: 1px solid #15231a;
    color: #718078;
    font-size: 13px;
}

@media (max-width: 700px) {
    nav {
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    nav div:last-child {
        display: none;
    }

    header {
        min-height: 85vh;
    }

    section {
        padding: 60px 6%;
    }

    .hero p {
        font-size: 16px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">[<span>CYBER</span>]</div>

    <div>
        <a href="#labs">Labs</a>
        <a href="#challenges">Challenges</a>
        <a href="#terminal">Terminal</a>
        <a href="#learn">Learn</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="hero">

    <div class="tag">&gt; INITIALIZING CYBER HACKING LAB...</div>

    <h1>
        Learn Cybersecurity.<br>
        <span>Think Like a Hacker.</span>
    </h1>

    <p>
        A practical cybersecurity learning environment for ethical
        hacking, penetration testing, network security and defensive
        security.
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="#labs">Enter the Lab</a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href="#learn">Start Learning</a>

</div>

</header>


<section id="labs">

<div class="section-title">
    <small>// TRAINING ENVIRONMENT</small>
    <h2>Cyber Labs</h2>
</div>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🌐</div>
    <h3>Web Security</h3>
    <p>
        Learn the fundamentals of web application security,
        vulnerabilities and defensive techniques.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🔑</div>
    <h3>Authentication</h3>
    <p>
        Explore authentication concepts, password security
        and common weaknesses in controlled environments.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">📡</div>
    <h3>Network Security</h3>
    <p>
        Understand networks, traffic analysis, protocols
        and practical defensive security.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🛡️</div>
    <h3>Defensive Security</h3>
    <p>
        Practice identifying weaknesses and improving the
        security of systems you are authorized to test.
    </p>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="challenges">

<div class="section-title">
    <small>// PRACTICAL TRAINING</small>
    <h2>Challenges</h2>
</div>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
    <h3>Level 01 — Recon</h3>
    <p>Learn information gathering and basic security concepts.</p>

    <div class="progress">
        <span></span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h3>Level 02 — Web Security</h3>
    <p>Study common web vulnerabilities in controlled labs.</p>

    <div class="progress">
        <span style="width:15%"></span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h3>Level 03 — Network Defense</h3>
    <p>Analyze network concepts and practice defensive techniques.</p>

    <div class="progress">
        <span style="width:5%"></span>
    </div>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="terminal">

<div class="section-title">
    <small>// SIMULATED ENVIRONMENT</small>
    <h2>Lab Terminal</h2>
</div>

<div class="terminal">

<div class="terminal-bar">
    cyber-lab@training: ~
</div>

<div class="terminal-body">

<div>$ whoami</div>
<div class="white">student</div>
<br>

<div>$ status</div>
<div>ACCESS: AUTHORIZED</div>
<div>MODE: TRAINING</div>
<div>LAB: ONLINE</div>
<br>

<div>$ help</div>
<div class="white">
Available modules: labs / challenges / learning / defense
</div>

<br>

<div>$ _</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="learn">

<div class="section-title">
    <small>// KNOWLEDGE BASE</small>
    <h2>Learn</h2>
</div>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">📖</div>
    <h3>Cybersecurity Fundamentals</h3>
    <p>
        Build a strong foundation in security principles,
        threats and risk management.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">💻</div>
    <h3>Ethical Hacking</h3>
    <p>
        Understand ethical hacking methodologies using
        authorized training environments.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🔎</div>
    <h3>Security Analysis</h3>
    <p>
        Learn how security professionals identify,
        investigate and document weaknesses.
    </p>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<footer>
    © 2026 Cyber Hacking Lab | Ethical Cybersecurity Learning
</footer>


</body>
</html>


